==Battleground==
*8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Medu-san]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Midnite D.]] spawns.
**1 [[Midnite D.]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Ackey]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]] and [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]]. Bring other attackers as well to speed up the level like [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] as well as any Surge Immune units you may have like [[Awakened Naala]] or [[Awakened Doron]].

==Trivia==
*[[Cradle Shrine (Deadly)/Aku|Bad Instinct's Origin]], [[Summit Shrine (Merciless)/Aku|Bad Instinct's Apex]] and Bad Instinct's Refuge are the only [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] [[Enigma Stages]] not to follow the "X Cradle, X Summit, X Frontier" naming scheme for their maps.
*The "Instinct" in Bad Instinct's Origin, Bad Instinct's Apex and Bad Instinct's Refuge refers to Instinct Orbs, a literal translation of Talent Orbs' Japanese name (本能玉 ''Hon'nō-dama'').

